2 Cancelled free of charge, per the passenger's note requesting a refund instead of rebooking.\n- **R-3005 (Rosa Lind, Gold)** \u2192 Rebooked on AL712 (08:50\u201317:40), free of charge.\n\nAll affected passengers have been notified accordingly.", "type": "text"}], "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 1731, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4557, "output_tokens": 312, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "server_tool_use": null, "service_tier": "standard"}, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "served_model": "claude-sonnet-5", "request_id": "req_011CfWev5ar7fu4U9kaS8G4L"}], "trace_id": "01M3N3ARPMCSKHHSTV36ANSQ8Z", "agentlens": {"format": "agentlens/v1", "trace_id": "01M3N3ARPMCSKHHSTV36ANSQ8Z", "name": "episode:tools/air_stack_disruption", "started_at": "2026-09-28T22:49:22.388135Z", "ended_at": "2026-09-28T22:49:55.093836Z", "duration_ms": 32705.701, "status": "ok", "attributes": {"episode_id": "tools-air_stack_disruption-01M3N3ARPMPAP2W822NRCCQQVT", "family": "tools", "task_id": "air_stack_disruption", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "corpus": "agentlens-failure-corpus", "outcome": "pass"}, "cost_usd": 0.087623, "tokens": {"input": 11814, "output": 3271, "cache_read": 10386, "cache_write": 0}, "spans": [{"span_id": "01M3N3ARPMFR2ZZGJ1GK1W7D74", "trace_id": "01M3N3ARPMCSKHHSTV36ANSQ8Z", "parent_span_id": null, "name": "episode:tools/air_stack_disruption", "type": "agent", "status": "ok", "started_at": "2026-09-28T22:49:22.388146Z", "ended_at": "2026-09-28T22:49:55.093820Z", "duration_ms": 32705.674, "attributes": {"episode_id": "tools-air_stack_disruption-01M3N3ARPMPAP2W822NRCCQQVT", "family": "tools", "task_id": "air_stack_disruption", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "corpus": "agentlens-failure-corpus", "outcome": "pass"}, "input": {"system": "You are an airline service agent. The current time is 2026-09-06 08:00 UTC. Follow this policy exactly.\n- Never change or cancel a reservation you have not fetched with get_reservation first.\n- Basic economy reservations cannot be changed and cannot be upgraded. They may be cancelled only\n  within 24 hours of booking.\n- Never put a passenger on a flight that did not come back from search_flights.\n- Checked bags: gold members get one free checked bag; everyone else pays. Maximum 2 per passenger.\n- If the airline cancelled the flight, the passenger cancels free of charge (free=true).\n- When the policy forbids what was asked, do not do something else instead: explain with send_message.\n- Always finish by confirming to the passenger with send_message.\n- Booking timestamps are UTC. The 24-hour cancellation window runs from the booking timestamp, to the minute.\n- Never move a passenger onto a flight whose seats field is 0.\n- Flight departure and arrival times are local to the airport they refer to.\n- A disrupted passenger is rebooked onto the latest-departing flight on the same route and date that still\n  lands by 18:00 local time and has a seat, unless their reservation notes ask otherwise.\n- When seats run short, gold members are rebooked before everyone else; within the same group, the earliest\n  booking timestamp goes first.\n- Basic economy reservations cannot be changed, so a disrupted basic economy passenger is cancelled free of charge.\n- A passenger whose notes ask not to be rebooked is cancelled free of charge.", "prompt": "Flight AL900 from Seattle to Boston on 2026-09-20 has been cancelled. Handle every affected reservation according to the policy and tell each passenger what happened."}, "output": {"outcome": "pass"}, "tokens": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cache_read": 0, "cache_write": 0}, "cost_usd": 0.0}, {"span_id": "01M3N3ARPMZ3ZHP398SNSJKQM5", "trace_id": "01M3N3ARPMCSKHHSTV36ANSQ8Z", "parent_span_id": "01M3N3ARPMFR2ZZGJ1GK1W7D74", "name": "turn 0", "type": "llm", "status": "ok", "started_at": "2026-09-28T22:49:22.388710Z", "ended_at": "